---
---

<section id="fitur" class="relative scroll-mt-20 py-20 lg:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-700/20 bg-emerald-50 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800">
        Keunggulan Utama
      </div>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
        Kenyamanan Tilawah di Setiap Sela Waktu
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        Mushaf menghilangkan hambatan teknis yang biasanya membuat tilawah tertunda. Tanpa jeda, tanpa iklan, dan selalu mengingat bacaan terakhir Anda.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid Showcase (Wide & Rich Visuals) -->
    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <!-- Bento Item 1: Wide Card (Span 12 / 7) - Read from where you left -->
      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-[32px] border border-slate-200/80 bg-white shadow-[0_20px_50px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] transition-all hover:border-emerald-700/30 hover:shadow-xl lg:col-span-12 xl:col-span-7">
        <div class="grid h-full items-center gap-6 p-8 sm:p-10 md:grid-cols-2">
          <!-- Text Content -->
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <span class="inline-block text-xs font-extrabold tracking-wider uppercase text-emerald-700">
                Fitur Khas Mushaf
              </span>
              <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
                Buka & Lanjutkan dalam 1 Detik.
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-base">
                Menunggu kereta, mengantre, atau jeda istirahat 3 menit? Cukup buka aplikasi dan Anda langsung berada di ayat yang sedang Anda baca.
              </p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
                Tidak perlu lagi mengingat nomor halaman, mencari nama surah, atau repot memasang bookmark manual. Menandai bacaan kini menjadi opsional, bukan beban.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Highlight Quote Box -->
            <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50/80 p-4 border border-emerald-700/15">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-900">
                <span class="text-base">⚡</span>
                <span>Langsung ke Ayat Terakhir Saat Aplikasi Dibuka</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Feature Illustration Image -->
          <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-md">
            <img
              src="/images/feature-resume.jpg"
              alt="Ilustrasi membaca Al-Quran dengan mudah di mana saja"
              class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 2: Card (Span 12 / 5) - Full Offline & Zero Ads -->
      <div class="group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-[32px] border border-slate-200/80 bg-white p-8 shadow-[0_20px_50px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] transition-all hover:border-emerald-700/30 hover:shadow-xl sm:p-10 lg:col-span-12 xl:col-span-5">
        <div>
          <span class="inline-block text-xs font-extrabold tracking-wider uppercase text-amber-700">
            Bebas Distraksi
          </span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
            100% Offline & Nol Iklan Mengganggu
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-base">
            Seluruh 30 juz, 114 surah, dan terjemahan langsung tertanam di ponsel Anda sejak awal. Tanpa kuota tersedot, tanpa banner iklan, dan tanpa video pop-up yang merusak kekhusyukan.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Visual Image -->
        <div class="mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-md">
          <img
            src="/images/feature-offline.jpg"
            alt="Ilustrasi tilawah tenang tanpa koneksi internet dan bebas iklan"
            class="h-60 w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 3: Full Width Banner (Span 12) - Official Kemenag RI Mushaf -->
      <div id="kemenag" class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-[32px] border border-slate-200/80 bg-white shadow-[0_20px_50px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] transition-all hover:border-emerald-700/30 hover:shadow-xl lg:col-span-12">
        <div class="grid items-center gap-8 p-8 sm:p-12 lg:grid-cols-12">
          <!-- Image Left -->
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-md lg:col-span-5">
            <img
              src="/images/feature-kemenag.jpg"
              alt="Khat Rasm Usmani Mushaf Standar Kementerian Agama RI"
              class="h-72 w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>

          <!-- Text Right -->
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-center lg:col-span-7">
            <span class="inline-block text-xs font-extrabold tracking-wider uppercase text-teal-700">
              Standar Sahih & Terpercaya
            </span>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl">
              Rasm Usmani Standar Kemenag RI dengan Tajwid Berwarna Jernih
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-lg">
              Teks mushaf disusun secara teliti mengikuti standar resmi Kementerian Agama Republik Indonesia (Kemenag RI). Font Arab tampil proporsional, tanda waqaf presisi, serta panduan tajwid berwarna yang membantu tilawah tartil tanpa membuat mata lelah.
            </p>

            <!-- Tajwid Legend Badges -->
            <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs font-semibold">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-emerald-700/20 bg-emerald-50 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-emerald-800">
                <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-600"></span>
                Ikhfa & Idgham
              </span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-blue-700/20 bg-blue-50 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-blue-800">
                <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-blue-600"></span>
                Qalqalah
              </span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-700/20 bg-amber-50 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-amber-800">
                <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-amber-600"></span>
                Ghunnah
              </span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-purple-700/20 bg-purple-50 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-purple-800">
                <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-purple-600"></span>
                Mad Wajib / Jaiz
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
